 arch/arm/boot/dts/armada-xp-gp.dts               | 62 +++++++++--------
 arch/arm/boot/dts/armada-xp-openblocks-ax3-4.dts | 62 +++++++++--------
 3 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)

